      "type": "poem",
      "text": "•      Sit in groups of five.\n•      Each group will discuss and create two questions\non the poem Vocation using the question words\nfrom the WH-family. Note down the questions.\n•      Now, put your textbooks back in your bags.\n•      Each group will get to share their questions with\nthe class.\n•      One group will present their questions, and the\nremaining groups will answer the questions. This\nwill continue till all the groups have shared their\nquestions.",
