      "text": "The speaker of the poem wants\nto do many things.\n• Think of a time when you wanted\nto do many things but could not.\n• What were the things you wanted\nto do?\n• What difficulties did you face in\ndoing many things at once?\n• How did it make you feel?\n• Share your views with your\nclassmates.",
